
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <meta name="description" content="Barber.Co — Section Layanan & Tentang. Potongan rambut terbaik, booking tanpa antre." />
  <title>Barber.Co — Layanan & Tentang</title>

  <!-- Font: Oswald (condensed bold untuk judul) + Inter (body) -->
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link
    href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Oswald:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap"
    rel="stylesheet"
  />

  <style>
    /* ============ RESET ============ */
    *,
    *::before,
    *::after {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    /* ============ PALET WARNA (dari dokumen desain) ============ */
    :root {
      --charcoal: #1a1a17;      /* hitam arang — navbar CTA, kartu populer, stats bar */
      --charcoal-2: #161613;
      --cream: #edebe3;         /* latar utama krem hangat */
      --cream-2: #f2efe6;       /* latar section layanan */
      --card-light: #e6e3da;    /* kartu layanan terang */
      --lime: #bff747;          /* aksen hijau lime — angka, titik, tombol, ikon */
      --lime-deep: #a8c93a;     /* lime lebih dalam untuk ikon */
      --sage: #a9b49a;          /* hijau sage — teks sekunder */
      --text: #1e1e1c;          /* teks utama hitam */
      --text-muted: #6e6a5f;    /* teks abu deskripsi */
      --text-muted-2: #8a8a80;  /* teks abu lebih muda */
      --border: #d8d5ca;        /* garis pemisah footer */
      --divider-dark: #3a3a35;  /* garis pemisah di stats bar gelap */
      --maxw: 1200px;
    }

    html {
      -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }

    body {
      font-family: "Inter", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI",
        Roboto, sans-serif;
      background: var(--cream);
      color: var(--text);
      line-height: 1.6;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: var(--maxw);
      margin: 0 auto;
      width: 100%;
      padding: 0 clamp(1rem, 5vw, 4rem);
    }

    /* ============ TIPOGRAFI ============ */
    .display {
      font-family: "Oswald", "Inter", sans-serif;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      line-height: 1.05;
      letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      font-family: "Inter", sans-serif;
      font-size: clamp(0.7rem, 1.6vw, 0.8rem);
      font-weight: 600;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.22em;
      color: var(--text-muted-2);
    }

    .lime-dot {
      color: var(--lime);
    }

    /* ============ STATS BAR ============ */
    .stats {
      background: var(--charcoal);
      padding: clamp(1.25rem, 3vw, 1.75rem) 0;
    }

    .stats-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: clamp(0.5rem, 2vw, 1rem);
      align-items: center;
    }

    .stat {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 0 clamp(0.5rem, 2vw, 1rem);
      position: relative;
    }

    .stat + .stat::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      left: 0;
      top: 15%;
      bottom: 15%;
      width: 1px;
      background: var(--divider-dark);
    }

    .stat-num {
      font-family: "Oswald", sans-serif;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--lime);
      font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 2rem);
      line-height: 1;
      letter-spacing: 0.01em;
    }

    .stat-label {
      margin-top: 0.35rem;
      font-size: clamp(0.65rem, 1.6vw, 0.78rem);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.14em;
      color: #d8d8d0;
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    /* ============ SECTION: LAYANAN ============ */
    .services {
      background: var(--cream-2);
      padding: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 5.5rem) 0;
    }

    .section-head {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr;
      gap: clamp(1rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
      align-items: end;
      margin-bottom: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem);
    }

    .section-head .title {
      font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 6.5vw, 3.6rem);
      margin-top: 0.6rem;
    }

    .section-head .desc {
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-size: clamp(0.9rem, 1.8vw, 1rem);
      max-width: 38ch;
      padding-bottom: 0.4rem;
    }

    /* Grid kartu layanan */
    .cards {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: clamp(0.75rem, 2vw, 1.25rem);
      align-items: stretch;
    }

    .card {
      background: var(--card-light);
      padding: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.25rem);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      min-height: clamp(220px, 28vw, 280px);
      position: relative;
      transition: transform 0.25s ease, box-shadow 0.25s ease;
    }

    .card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-4px);
    }

    /* Kartu populer — gelap, menonjol, sedikit naik */
    .card.popular {
      background: var(--charcoal);
      color: #fff;
      transform: translateY(-8px);
    }

    .card.popular:hover {
      transform: translateY(-12px);
    }

    .card-icon {
      width: clamp(28px, 5vw, 36px);
      height: clamp(28px, 5vw, 36px);
      color: var(--lime-deep);
      margin-bottom: clamp(1rem, 2.5vw, 1.5rem);
    }

    .card.popular .card-icon {
      color: var(--lime);
    }

    .card-title {
      font-family: "Oswald", sans-serif;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: clamp(1.3rem, 3vw, 1.6rem);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.01em;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    .card-desc {
      font-size: clamp(0.82rem, 1.7vw, 0.9rem);
      color: var(--text-muted-2);
      flex: 1;
      margin-bottom: clamp(1.25rem, 3vw, 1.75rem);
    }

    .card.popular .card-desc {
      color: #b0b0a6;
    }

    .card-price {
      font-family: "Oswald", sans-serif;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: clamp(1rem, 2.4vw, 1.15rem);
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    }

    /* Badge POPULAR */
    .badge {
      position: absolute;
      top: clamp(1rem, 2.5vw, 1.5rem);
      right: clamp(1rem, 2.5vw, 1.5rem);
      font-family: "Inter", sans-serif;
      font-size: 0.62rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      color: var(--lime);
    }

    /* ============ SECTION: TENTANG ============ */
    .about {
      background: var(--cream);
      padding: clamp(3.5rem, 9vw, 6rem) 0;
    }

    .about-head {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.3fr 1fr;
      gap: clamp(1.5rem, 5vw, 4rem);
      align-items: start;
    }

    .about-title {
      font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 7vw, 4rem);
      margin-top: 0.75rem;
    }

    .about-desc {
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-size: clamp(0.95rem, 1.9vw, 1.05rem);
      line-height: 1.7;
      padding-top: 0.5rem;
      max-width: 46ch;
    }

    /* ============ FOOTER ============ */
    .footer {
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: var(--cream);
      padding: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.25rem) 0;
    }

    .footer-inner {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 1rem;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .footer-logo {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.55rem;
      font-family: "Oswald", sans-serif;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: clamp(1rem, 2.5vw, 1.25rem);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      color: var(--text);
    }

    .logo-mark {
      width: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 1.9rem);
      height: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 1.9rem);
      background: var(--lime);
      color: var(--charcoal);
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: clamp(0.85rem, 2vw, 1.05rem);
    }

    .footer-copy {
      font-size: clamp(0.72rem, 1.7vw, 0.82rem);
      color: var(--text-muted-2);
      text-align: center;
      flex: 1;
      min-width: 200px;
    }

    .footer-top {
      font-size: clamp(0.78rem, 1.8vw, 0.85rem);
      color: var(--text-muted);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 500;
      transition: color 0.2s;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .footer-top:hover {
      color: var(--charcoal);
    }

    /* ============ RESPONSIF ============ */
    @media (max-width: 860px) {
      .cards {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        max-width: 480px;
        margin: 0 auto;
      }

      .card.popular {
        transform: none;
      }

      .card.popular:hover {
        transform: translateY(-4px);
      }

      .section-head,
      .about-head {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .section-head .desc {
        padding-bottom: 0;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 480px) {
      .stats-grid {
        gap: 0;
      }

      .stat {
        padding: 0 0.25rem;
      }
    }

    /* Aksesibilitas */
    a:focus-visible,
    button:focus-visible {
      outline: 2px solid var(--lime);
      outline-offset: 3px;
    }

    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      *,
      *::before,
      *::after {
        transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;
        animation-duration: 0.01ms !important;
      }
      html {
        scroll-behavior: auto;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- ============ STATS BAR ============ -->
  <section class="stats" id="top" aria-label="Statistik Barber.Co">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="stats-grid">
        <div class="stat">
          <div class="stat-num">1.2K+</div>
          <div class="stat-label">Happy clients</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat">
          <div class="stat-num">5+</div>
          <div class="stat-label">Professional barbers</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat">
          <div class="stat-num">4.9/5</div>
          <div class="stat-label">Customer rating</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ SECTION LAYANAN ============ -->
  <section class="services" id="layanan" aria-labelledby="services-title">
    <div class="container">

      <!-- Header section -->
      <div class="section-head">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">What we do</p>
          <h2 class="display title" id="services-title">
            Our Services<span class="lime-dot">.</span>
          </h2>
        </div>
        <p class="desc">
          Perawatan dan potongan yang disesuaikan dengan gaya personalmu.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Grid 3 kartu layanan -->
      <div class="cards">

        <!-- Kartu 1: Haircut -->
        <article class="card">
          <svg class="card-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"
               stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"
               stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <circle cx="6" cy="6" r="3"></circle>
            <circle cx="6" cy="18" r="3"></circle>
            <line x1="20" y1="4" x2="8.12" y2="15.88"></line>
            <line x1="14.47" y1="14.48" x2="20" y2="20"></line>
            <line x1="8.12" y1="8.12" x2="12" y2="12"></line>
          </svg>
          <h3 class="card-title">Haircut</h3>
          <p class="card-desc">
            Potongan rambut rapi sesuai bentuk wajah dan gaya pilihanmu.
          </p>
          <div class="card-price">Rp 35.000</div>
        </article>

        <!-- Kartu 2: Haircut + Wash (POPULAR, gelap) -->
        <article class="card popular">
          <span class="badge">Popular</span>
          <svg class="card-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"
               stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"
               stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M12 2 L22 12 L12 22 L2 12 Z"></path>
            <path d="M12 7 L17 12 L12 17 L7 12 Z"></path>
          </svg>
          <h3 class="card-title">Haircut + Wash</h3>
          <p class="card-desc">
            Potongan rambut dilengkapi keramas agar terasa lebih segar.
          </p>
          <div class="card-price">Rp 50.000</div>
        </article>

        <!-- Kartu 3: Beard Trim -->
        <article class="card">
          <svg class="card-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"
               stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"
               stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <line x1="3" y1="6" x2="21" y2="6"></line>
            <line x1="3" y1="12" x2="21" y2="12"></line>
            <line x1="3" y1="18" x2="21" y2="18"></line>
            <circle cx="7" cy="6" r="1.2"></circle>
            <circle cx="14" cy="12" r="1.2"></circle>
            <circle cx="9" cy="18" r="1.2"></circle>
          </svg>
          <h3 class="card-title">Beard Trim</h3>
          <p class="card-desc">
            Rapikan dan bentuk jenggot agar terlihat bersih dan presisi.
          </p>
          <div class="card-price">Rp 25.000</div>
        </article>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ SECTION TENTANG ============ -->
  <section class="about" id="tentang" aria-labelledby="about-title">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="about-head">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Why Barber.Co</p>
          <h2 class="display about-title" id="about-title">
            Detail Makes<br />The Difference<span class="lime-dot">.</span>
          </h2>
        </div>
        <p class="about-desc">
          Kami percaya potongan rambut yang tepat bisa meningkatkan rasa
          percaya diri. Nikmati suasana nyaman, barber profesional, dan
          layanan yang fokus pada detail.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ FOOTER ============ -->
  <footer class="footer">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="footer-inner">
        <div class="footer-logo">
          <span class="logo-mark" aria-hidden="true">B</span>
          <span>Barber<span class="lime-dot">.</span>Co</span>
        </div>
        <p class="footer-copy">
          © 2026 Barber.Co. All rights reserved.
        </p>
        <a href="#top" class="footer-top">Back to top ↑</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
